WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.075 --> 00:00:05.992
(buzz)

00:00:10.127 --> 00:00:11.750
- All right, you got Ned,

00:00:11.750 --> 00:00:12.843
Rob,

00:00:12.843 --> 00:00:13.760
Khal Drogo.

00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:15.760
 

00:00:23.294 --> 00:00:25.211
(buzz)

00:00:26.791 --> 00:00:30.208
Jon, but maybe that doesn't really count.

00:00:37.936 --> 00:00:39.103
Renly, Summer,

00:00:40.693 --> 00:00:41.526
Shaggydog.

00:00:43.212 --> 00:00:45.629
And then Hodor, that was sad.

00:00:58.099 --> 00:00:59.767
That stuff's hard.

00:00:59.767 --> 00:01:01.357
But you know what isn't?

00:01:01.357 --> 00:01:03.024
Registering to vote.

00:01:03.920 --> 00:01:06.442
I hope you all understand
that you have the power

00:01:06.442 --> 00:01:08.892
to shape our country's course.

00:01:08.900 --> 00:01:10.560
Don't take that for granted.

00:01:10.560 --> 00:01:12.268
Go ahead and register now at

00:01:12.268 --> 00:01:14.101
buzzfeed.turbovote.org

00:01:16.252 --> 00:01:17.836
Now, if you'll excuse me,

00:01:17.836 --> 00:01:21.336
I've got a meeting with my vice president.

00:01:22.643 --> 00:01:24.310
Tywin.

00:01:29.400 --> 00:01:31.400
Joffrey, thank God.

